  formula('ode','First-order homogeneous differential equation','frac{dy}{dt}+ay=0 ⇒ y(t)=y(0)e^{−at}','a is the constant coefficient and y(0) the initial value.','Use for a constant-coefficient first-order natural response.','If a=2 s⁻¹ and y(0)=3, then y(1)=3e⁻² ≈ 0.406.')
