  formula('wavelength','Wave speed and wavelength','λ=frac{v}{f} ; η= sqrt{μ/ε}','v is propagation speed; μ and ε are permeability and permittivity.','Use η for a lossless homogeneous medium.','At 300 MHz in free space, λ≈1 m.')
